{"background":"#6b2424","slides":[{"elements":[{"id":"74f2de16-67f0-49bc-857e-143f46bcd2e7","kind":"text","x":39,"y":29,"w":536,"h":76,"text":"The following was prompted into Chat GPT Image 2 - feelings as data vs feelings as commands. The AI outputted an image that solely looks at the positives of feelings as data, and the negatives of feelings as commands.","fontSize":16},{"id":"8f7d58d2-7a48-4353-aa58-d253c406b7be","kind":"image","x":59,"y":116,"w":483,"h":350,"filename":"presentations/c4c8cbc4-64ea-456c-aebe-7aebccdc62e4/dbcaba98-8af6-445b-86a7-41ecc677c134.png"},{"id":"6b266f65-e214-48c3-876e-be3fd80f27d9","kind":"text","x":367,"y":472,"w":181,"h":41,"text":"Open Chat Gpt","fontSize":25},{"id":"5c65bdc6-2397-4f0f-a61e-6654d6d96907","kind":"hotspot","x":353,"y":476,"w":186,"h":35,"script":"api.nextSlide()","action":{"type":"openUrl","url":"https://chatgpt.com/"}}]},{"elements":[{"id":"6c2919ee-b0b7-4bd6-bc2d-23c1c8053208","kind":"text","x":40,"y":40,"w":506,"h":150,"text":"The AI did not present the pitfalls of feelings as data, nor the benifets of feelings as commands. I told the AI - Yes thats one side of feelings as commands. I want you to take it holistically. It responded by adding more information in that same problematic frame.","fontSize":20},{"id":"2a7c5dc9-0815-43dd-b362-3623d56b2963","kind":"image","x":28,"y":191,"w":440,"h":316,"filename":"presentations/c4c8cbc4-64ea-456c-aebe-7aebccdc62e4/9c14a869-35b9-4d8e-8aa5-2248bf35cb47.png"},{"id":"d2e476f2-ccda-44ea-bb9d-0c5cd537d332","kind":"text","x":491,"y":320,"w":94,"h":71,"text":"Previous Slide --->","fontSize":20},{"id":"9610d949-b7f4-4f2c-a88f-cf24910673a5","kind":"hotspot","x":488,"y":323,"w":90,"h":54,"script":"api.nextSlide()","action":{"type":"prevSlide"}}]},{"elements":[{"id":"88a8e006-473a-4e5a-afac-1338b4d821bd","kind":"text","x":40,"y":40,"w":514,"h":163,"text":"At this point I was frustrated with the AI, so I tried to say it plainly - I mean your treating feelings as commands as purely negative. It isn't in many, many situations. This gave me the kind of result that I wanted.","fontSize":20},{"id":"eac1c468-2efb-4557-a93b-193da8443251","kind":"image","x":64,"y":169,"w":475,"h":333,"filename":"presentations/c4c8cbc4-64ea-456c-aebe-7aebccdc62e4/5de48d25-f83d-449d-b295-9c8d9d79f470.png"},{"id":"04145bec-ac11-4342-9470-eb3aeaeec372","kind":"text","x":547,"y":274,"w":48,"h":86,"text":"Next Slide ---->","fontSize":20},{"id":"27f10208-3104-484a-b893-d86c1f61182c","kind":"hotspot","x":543,"y":280,"w":53,"h":72,"script":"api.nextSlide()","action":{"type":"nextSlide"}}]},{"elements":[{"id":"f2a85fc4-e78d-4aee-a90d-1058506e760d","kind":"image","x":175,"y":119,"w":240,"h":180,"filename":"presentations/c4c8cbc4-64ea-456c-aebe-7aebccdc62e4/b067121c-4b54-4b1b-bb0c-53a65870eadf.webp"},{"id":"79b9f270-f070-439f-88ff-65b2d4598d2c","kind":"text","x":201,"y":41,"w":240,"h":60,"text":"Well howdy there, im Turny the turnip!","fontSize":20},{"id":"27428374-bae9-4bac-a8f5-812d964ae435","kind":"text","x":240,"y":347,"w":76,"h":88,"text":"Go back to the start","fontSize":20},{"id":"c8919c0b-5ef4-4d6f-969e-90140c0cc862","kind":"hotspot","x":227,"y":339,"w":91,"h":95,"action":{"type":"gotoSlide","slide":1}},{"id":"a31d2ac8-e997-4c64-b91e-dbfd476a7bee","kind":"hotspot","x":445,"y":190,"w":160,"h":120,"action":{"type":"nextSlide"}}]}]}